From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:31:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(widget): 3x3 quick widget with Food and Workout buttons

Rest, Charge and Effort, live heart rate and strap battery from the same
snapshot as the 2x2, plus two buttons: Food opens the camera for a meal
photo and Workout opens the training sheet (or the running workout).
A separate picker entry; the 2x2 widget is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
